---
A collection is a block whose body lists other blocks. Nothing special in the
code — it is the same file format, the same parser, the same URL scheme. That
is what "everything is a block" buys you.

![[field-recording]]

Because a collection is a block, a collection can hold a collection. Nesting
comes free: [[seeing]].
